    "faq_accordion_m3GjeY": {
      "type": "faq-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "question_giLkXQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does the Ninja Luxe™ Café Mini require special barista training to use?",
            "answer": "<p>Not at all. It features Barista Assist technology designed specifically to eliminate the steep learning curve of traditional espresso machines. With pre-calibrated buttons, the machine guides your brewing, automatically adjusting water temperature and pressure for single, double, or quadruple shots.</p>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_36wNwy": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What types of drinks can I make with this machine?",
            "answer": "<p>It is a versatile 3-in-1 coffee station. You can extract authentic high-pressure espresso shots, brew classic drip-style coffee, or create smooth rapid cold brew in under three minutes. With the automated hands-free milk frother, you can craft lattes, cappuccinos, macchiatos, and iced drinks using dairy or plant-based milks.</p><h3></h3>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_e4hhdC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can the automated frother handle plant-based milks like oat or almond?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The automated frother has calibrated texture settings for both dairy and plant-based alternatives. It produces consistent, silky microfoam for latte art without scorching oat, almond, or soy milk.</p><h3></h3>",
            "question_color": "",
            "question_font_size_desktop": 16,
            "question_font_size_mobile": 15,
            "question_font_weight": "500",
            "answer_color": "",
            "answer_font_size_desktop": 15,
            "answer_font_size_mobile": 14,
            "answer_font_weight": "400"
          }
        },
        "question_HKe6yp": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it plug into a standard Canadian electrical wall outlet?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, 100%. The machine is built for standard North American electrical systems and plugs directly into any regular 110V/120V household wall outlet across Canada, without requiring special electrical adapters or custom wiring.</p>",
