            "question": "How long does shipping take and are there any customs duties for Canada?",
            "answer": "<p>Orders ship fast nationwide across Canada, typically arriving in 2 to 5 business days with full online tracking. All local and provincial taxes are handled at checkout, meaning your order is 100% guaranteed with zero surprise import fees or customs duties upon delivery.</p>",
